  "name": "Question 8",
  "problem": "Let $G=HM.$ What is the value of ${g}_{31}$, if\n\n$$\nH=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 2 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}],\\,M=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 5 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}]?\n$$\n\n${g}_{31}=$ \n{{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "Multiplying the $3$rd row in $H$ by the $1$st column in $M$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}_{31} & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot 1+5\\cdot 3+1\\cdot 0+0\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-3+15+0+0 \\\\  & =12.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
